            "The revelation of the eighth god shattered the Dominion's political order. The city of Marrowpoint, which had always been sympathetic to Kaelgorath's worship, withdrew from the confederation. Thornwall followed. The High Council found itself reduced to a coalition of three cities.",
            "In the year 1,364, the ruler of Marrowpoint, Lady Seraphine Blackthorn, issued a proclamation: 'The gods of the Elysian Circle have deceived us. They have stolen the eighth aspect and hidden it from the world. Kaelgorath is not a threat. Kaelgorath is a cure. I call upon all people of good conscience to join me in demanding that the Elysian Circle restore the eighth aspect. If they refuse, I will restore the circle myself.'",
            "The priest of Ignareth, Kael Ironhand, raised an army and marched on Marrowpoint. The War of the Eighth Aspect lasted three years and ended in a stalemate. The High Council, exhausted, proposed a compromise: a formal debate between the representatives of the seven gods and the worshippers of Kaelgorath, to be held in the Chamber of Echoes. The debate was scheduled for the year 1,370. It never took place."
