            "In Marrowpoint, Lady Seraphine Blackthorn watched the destruction and felt cold certainty: she had been wrong. Not about Kaelgorath. About the cost. She turned to her lieutenant, Dravos — the same Captain Dravos who had sharpened his sword in Aelindra's barracks years ago. 'Is this what he wanted?' she asked. Dravos looked at the destruction and said nothing."
